{"unit_id":"mazov2love__dsh-remote-control#card-zh","repo":"mazov2love/dsh-remote-control","commit":"82573b8add4115db3b70a9181590351137f78ee0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Remote Control 是面向 DSH Agent 的跨实例控制插件，可在 DSH 工具中连接一个或多个独立运行的 DSH。它通过已认证的远端接口创建会话或工作区、发送任务，并提供状态查看、增量读取回复、搜索和本地引用管理。还可按需查看历史、调整会话模型与权限，并将超出返回预算的结果分段读取。适合需要让多个 DSH 实例协作、委派任务或管理远端会话的用户。使用前需配置目标地址和启动令牌；本机保存连接状态与引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:16","src/controller.js:104","src/controller.js:191","src/client.js:47"]}
{"unit_id":"mazov2love__dsh-remote-control#card-en","repo":"mazov2love/dsh-remote-control","commit":"82573b8add4115db3b70a9181590351137f78ee0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Remote Control lets a DSH agent operate other DSH instances through authenticated tools. It creates sessions, sends tasks, checks status, reads new replies, searches sessions, and saves local references. Configure target addresses and launch tokens; references and read state are stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:16","src/controller.js:104","src/controller.js:191","src/client.js:47"]}
