{"unit_id":"mazov2love__dsh-remote-control#feature-1","repo":"mazov2love/dsh-remote-control","commit":"82573b8add4115db3b70a9181590351137f78ee0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Remote Control 的功能「创建远端会话」：调用 dsh_create 可在选定目标上新建会话，或注册工作区目录；创建后会保存本地引用，便于后续工具复用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:17","src/controller.js:104"]}
{"unit_id":"mazov2love__dsh-remote-control#feature-2","repo":"mazov2love/dsh-remote-control","commit":"82573b8add4115db3b70a9181590351137f78ee0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Remote Control 的功能「发送任务并取得回执」：调用 dsh_send 将消息交给远端会话，返回接收回执；目标会独立继续工作，调用方可之后查询状态或读取回复。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:19","src/controller.js:142"]}
{"unit_id":"mazov2love__dsh-remote-control#feature-3","repo":"mazov2love/dsh-remote-control","commit":"82573b8add4115db3b70a9181590351137f78ee0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Remote Control 的功能「增量查看远端回复」：调用 dsh_status 的 new 视图可读取尚未消费的助手文本；成功返回后推进本地读取游标，也可选择预览最新回复。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:20","src/controller.js:191"]}
{"unit_id":"mazov2love__dsh-remote-control#feature-4","repo":"mazov2love/dsh-remote-control","commit":"82573b8add4115db3b70a9181590351137f78ee0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Remote Control 的功能「管理引用并搜索会话」：使用 dsh_refs 管理本地保存的会话或工作区引用，并用 dsh_search 搜索已保存引用或远端会话、工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:18","src/index.js:21","src/controller.js:225"]}
{"unit_id":"mazov2love__dsh-remote-control#caveat-1","repo":"mazov2love/dsh-remote-control","commit":"82573b8add4115db3b70a9181590351137f78ee0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Remote Control 需要为目标实例配置地址及启动令牌，认证后通过远端 API 操作会话；凭据可来自 authFile 或 tokenEnv。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:26","src/client.js:47","src/client.js:65"]}
